### 测试社保上下限查询 Agent
POST http://localhost:8080/agui/run/social-security
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "threadId": "test-social-security-7868768",
  "runId": "run-social-security-9799",
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg-1",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "查询上海 2025 社保缴费基数上下限，优先官方来源，并说明医保是否单独口径"
    }
  ],
  "forwardedProps": {
    "userId": "1",
    "agentContext": {
      "city": "上海",
      "period": "2025",
      "insuranceType": "社保"
    }
  }
}
